# Jira & reporting rules

- Basic test execution must never require Jira. `JIRA_MODE=fixture` reads `data/jira/*.json`.
- Publishing is dry-run by default; real writes need `JIRA_PUBLISH_ENABLED=true` AND `--approve`.
- Publish only numbers read from `reports/coverage/ac-coverage.json`. Never fabricate metrics.
- De-duplicate: run marker in comments, run-specific attachment names, idempotent remote-link `globalId`.
- Sanitize everything that leaves the machine (`sanitize()` / `sanitizeString()`); never upload videos/traces to Jira.
- Coverage statuses: Passed, Failed, Not executed, Not automated — computed from executed `verifyAC` steps only.
